  "description": "Complete Repository Framework for Entity Framework Core with Fluent Query Builder, Generic Repository Pattern, Unit of Work, Specification Pattern, Multi-Tenancy, Caching (Memory/Redis), Soft Delete, Audit Fields, and LINQ extensions. Build clean, maintainable data access layers with type-safe queries, automatic transaction management, and enterprise features. Perfect for Clean Architecture, DDD, and CQRS patterns. Supports .NET 9.0 and 10.0.",
